            'overview' => [
                'Most people arrive at business study from one of two directions. Either they are already working somewhere and want the vocabulary and structure behind what they do every day, or they are weighing up a degree and want something solid underneath them before committing three years. Qualifi built this award with both groups in mind, describing it as a career path for learners developing their capabilities in the business sector.',
                'The four core subjects are deliberately broad. An Introduction to the Business Environment sets the context a company operates in; Business Resources looks at what an organisation actually runs on; An Introduction to Marketing covers reaching customers; and Human Resource Management deals with the people side. Three further subjects sit in an optional group, covering business communication, workplace health and safety, and recruitment and selection.',
