                ['How is this different from the Level 3 Diploma in Business Management?', '<p>They are separate qualifications with separate numbers and no shared subjects. The business management award looks outward at the environment, resources, marketing and people function of a company. This one looks at the job of managing: operations, finance basics, teams, leadership, culture and welfare. Pick this if you are managing people. Pick the other if you want a general grounding in how a business works.</p>', 1],
