                ['Who teaches it?', '<p>An approved centre, not Qualifi. The awarding organisation writes the qualification, regulates the standards and issues the certificate once the centre has assessed you. This is why you should direct questions about start dates, timetables, teaching format and cost to the centre, and questions about the qualification itself to Qualifi.</p>', 5],
                ['Can I go on to a degree afterwards?', '<p>Qualifi names a Level 4 qualification or employment as the published routes from here, and does not mention a degree year for this particular award. Some of its other Level 3 diplomas do name a university route. If higher education is your plan, check what the universities you have in mind accept rather than assuming this award carries that route.</p>', 6],
