                'Most people who end up running something learn it by being handed responsibility and working it out. This award is built for the point after that, when the job has been done for a while and the paperwork has not caught up. Qualifi sets out three ways in, and a qualification is only one of them.',
                'Twelve subjects cover the ground a working manager actually meets. Leadership, communication and developing teams deal with people. Financial awareness, business operations and effective decision making deal with running things. Managing change, responding to the changing business environment, risk management, customer management, business development and business models and growing organisations deal with what happens when conditions shift.',
                'The size matters here. Completing the award is worth 240 credits, four times a standard Level 3 diploma, and Qualifi\'s published progression route is the final year of a UK university honours degree. Not the first year — the last one. The qualification number is 610/1675/5 and the award is accredited at Level 5 on the framework.',
