                'Qualifi is precise about who this serves: the knowledge and skills required by teachers and trainers in the further education and training skills sector. That phrase matters, and the page states it directly. The content follows — theories and models of learning, communication and assessment; planning and delivering inclusive teaching; using initial and diagnostic assessment to agree goals with individual learners; keeping a learning environment safe and inclusive.',
                'Twelve subjects run from the fundamentals of education and training, resource design, engaging learners and work planning, through to applied theories, lifelong learning, resource management and the principles of educational leadership and management. The award is 240 credits under number 610/3648/1, and Qualifi publishes a partial-completion provision worth knowing about.',
